From: wq-agent <wq-agent@dev.local>
Subject: [PATCH] feat(watermark): burn user + UTC time into frames before encode

Adds pixelflux::watermark. Text is read from STYX_WATERMARK_USER at
startup; no client setting can change or disable it. The CPU capture path
stamps both BGRA frame buffers (stride aware) ahead of the encoder, outside
any client-controlled setting.

